      <p class="lede">12 answer-first Q&amp;As on hiring a full-service clinic marketing agency for hair transplant + fue + fut clinics in Nashik, Maharashtra &mdash; costs in INR, compliance (Maharashtra Medical Council + MCI + ASCI medical advertising code + surgical facility norms), local landmarks (College Road + Gangapur Road + Panchavati + Indira Nagar), booking + patient-acquisition benchmarks, and how ITD GrowthLabs works with clinics that don't have in-house marketing teams.</p>
