    <div class="itdgl-clinic-intro">
      <p>Choosing a marketing agency for a hair transplant clinic in Nashik, Maharashtra is the highest-stakes marketing decision of these three clinic types. Hair transplant is a high-AOV surgical decision (Rs 60,000-4 lakh per procedure) with 2-8 week consideration cycles, medical-tourism catchment beyond Nashik, and strict ASCI + MCI advertising code enforcement. Moderate GMB competition — 50-70 clinics ranked. College Road + Gangapur Road medical cluster. This FAQ answers 12 questions Nashik hair transplant clinics ask about hiring a full-service marketing agency.</p><p>Sample procedure pricing in Nashik: FUE 1,500-2,500 grafts (Rs 60,000-1,50,000), FUE 2,500-4,000 grafts (Rs 1,20,000-2,80,000), Sapphire FUE premium (Rs 1,50,000-4,00,000), DHI premium (Rs 2,00,000-4,50,000), beard/eyebrow transplant (Rs 40,000-1,50,000).</p>
